 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 2.2,
   "t1": 8.2,
   "text": "What I See",
   "style": "title"
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.6,
   "t1": 8.2,
   "text": "a journal entry \u00b7 October 12",
   "style": "subtitle"
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.314,
   "t1": 14.913,
   "text": "\u201cYour eye is the lamp of your body.\u201d",
   "style": "verse"
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.132,
   "t1": 19.412,
   "text": "\u201cIf your eye sees clearly, your whole body benefits from the light.\u201d",
   "style": "verse"
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.512,
   "t1": 23.698,
   "text": "\u201cIf your eyesight is poor, your whole person is without light.\u201d",
   "style": "verse"
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.84,
   "t1": 22.797,
   "text": "Luke 11:34",
   "style": "ref"
  },
  {
   "t0": 24.435,
   "t1": 29.835,
   "text": "What I see, I consume.",
   "style": "big"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.991,
   "t1": 36.505,
   "text": "Lately, I\u2019ve been following AI trends on my Instagram.",
   "style": "light"
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.756,
   "t1": 41.421,
   "text": "I think I have more AI feeds than updates from my friends.",
   "style": "light"
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.521,
   "t1": 46.437,
   "text": "As a result, it\u2019s what I constantly think of \u2014 even in idle times.",
   "style": "light"
  },
  {
   "t0": 46.537,
   "t1": 50.835,
   "text": "I keep telling myself, \u201cOK, at least it\u2019s work related.\u201d",
   "style": "light"
  },
  {
   "t0": 51.051,
   "t1": 56.444,
   "text": "But I know\u2026 I am consumed by it.",
   "style": "lightbig"
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.245,
   "t1": 61.245,
   "text": "In contrast\u2026",
   "style": "light"
  },
  {
   "t0": 63.645,
   "t1": 67.645,
   "text": "On my recent birthday trip to the Japan Alps,",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 67.845,
   "t1": 72.545,
   "text": "I purposely uninstalled my social media and AI apps.",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 72.645,
   "t1": 77.645,
   "text": "I focused on the nature in front of me.",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 78.245,
   "t1": 84.845,
   "text": "It felt like living a life close to nature.",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 86.645,
   "t1": 91.245,
   "text": "What I see, I consume.",
   "style": "big"
  },
  {
   "t0": 92.801,
   "t1": 98.481,
   "text": "In today\u2019s gospel, I am reminded to bring Jesus\u2019 light into my whole being.",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 98.581,
   "t1": 102.511,
   "text": "Imagine seeing Christ every day\u2026",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 102.743,
   "t1": 106.211,
   "text": "Will I think the way He thinks?",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 106.442,
   "t1": 109.91,
   "text": "Will I grow more in His mercy and compassion?",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 111.405,
   "t1": 115.703,
   "text": "Lately, I was too \u201cbusy\u201d to pray.",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 115.955,
   "t1": 119.647,
   "text": "I don\u2019t even have a journal entry for the month of September.",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 119.747,
   "t1": 123.792,
   "text": "I want to go back to writing \u2014 and seeing God more.",
   "style": "body"
  },
  {
   "t0": 125.319,
   "t1": 129.892,
   "text": "To be able to go back to His holy presence every day is enough.",
   "style": "light"
  },
  {
   "t0": 129.992,
   "t1": 133.178,
   "text": "I hope to be able to again tomorrow.",
   "style": "light"
  },
  {
   "t0": 133.603,
   "t1": 137.214,
   "text": "In Jesus\u2019 Name, Amen.",
   "style": "lightbig"
  }
 ],
